(memory "workspace/choices" :when "the workspace's model, icon or theme must change, or the agent must say which ones are on offer")
- (settings) gives (:name "…" :model "provider/model" :icon "…" :theme id).
- (settings/models) lists models workspace can run on.
- (settings/icons) lists icons workspace can show in sidebar.
- (settings/themes) gives alist of (id . name) of themes app can wear.
- (settings/set :model "provider/model") or (settings/set :name "…") changes them. User approves first. New model answers from next turn.
- Model, icon and theme must be one of those lists. Unlisted one errors.
- (settings/set :icon "rocket") or (settings/set :theme "gruvbox-light") changes them.
- (settings/set :theme "dark") flips current theme to its dark twin. No dark
  twin: default dark theme.

(memory "workspace/chats" :when "the agent must find, rename, archive, restore or read another chat of this workspace")
- (chats) lists (:id id :title title), most recently active first.
- (chats :search "login" :limit 5) narrows by title. :limit caps the count.
- (chat/title "Debug login redirect") titles current chat.
- (chat/rename id "…") retitles another chat.
- (chat/archive id) takes chat out of sidebar. Cannot archive the chat you are
  in.
- (chats :archived t) lists archived chats, latest archived first.
  (chat/unarchive id) puts one back in sidebar.
- (chat/read id :last 10) gives another chat's last messages as (role . text).
User approves chat/archive and chat/read: chat/read brings whole other
conversation into this one.
